Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.74,0:00:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And the same thing works for screenshots as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So tap the Function key again and dictate whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you want to dictate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And along with the dictation you can grab screenshots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can navigate across different screens and grab
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,screenshots like you would, in a Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can copy links as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.58,0:00:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And once you are done gathering all the context
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,along with your dictation, go back to Apple Notes or any,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,input box for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe try Apple Notes for now and tap the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Function key again to submit the whole thing finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And what you'll see is that it pastes your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,dictation along with the things that you might have copied,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,like the links or some texts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And it also attaches all the screenshots, multiple of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,in the same dictation attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So this makes the entire input gathering process really easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if you are thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and in the same flow you are capturing the context
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.58,0:00:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so that you can send all of it as a, input to AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.22,0:01:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,, agent like ChatGPT or maybe Claude or Codex.
